# Line endings: normalise on commit, check out LF on every platform.
#
# Without this, `core.autocrlf=true` (a common Windows default, and what this
# machine has) makes git rewrite LF to CRLF on checkout and warn on every add,
# so the same file is LF or CRLF depending on who cloned it. Declaration files
# and the browser half are plain UTF-8 JavaScript; nothing here needs CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets stay untouched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.tgz binary
